website does not provision an assistant session.</p><div class="mt-6"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-current" title="Present in public source and used as described."><span aria-hidden="true">●</span>Current</span></div></div></div><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Simple</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">A local document workspace with assistant context.</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-fg-muted sm:text-lg">The website-app in the integration repository is the workspace you run yourself. A local model is optional. Follow that app&#x27;s own setup and account boundaries.</p></header><ul class="grid gap-3 text-sm text-fg-muted sm:grid-cols-2"><li class="surface px-4 py-3">A browser for this preview</li><li class="surface px-4 py-3">Documents are stored in this browser&#x27;s localStorage</li><li class="surface px-4 py-3">The static workspace preview cannot call a model; configured server chat is a separate path</li></ul><div class="mt-6"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border border-transparent font-medium whitespace-nowrap no-underline transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow,opacity,transform] duration-150 ease-out select-none focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:not-disabled:translate-y-px bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/80 h-11 rounded-md px-4 text-sm" href="/workspace">Abbey workspace</a></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Personas</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">Abbey, Aviva, Abi — profiles, not products.</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-fg-muted sm:text-lg">Routing is a design mechanism described in the ABI tree. Per-persona quality is evaluated, not assumed. Product ABI is violet; persona Abi is cyan.</p></header><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3"><article class="surface accent-edge [--edge:var(--abbey)] p-7"><h3 class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-display text-2xl"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-persona-abbey" aria-hidden="true"></span>Abbey</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-fg-subtle">Empathic polymath</p><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">High-EQ tutor and partner. Scaffolds, names uncertainty, and keeps the human in the loop.</p></article><article class="surface accent-edge [--edge:var(--aviva)] p-7"><h3 class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-display text-2xl"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-persona-aviva" aria-hidden="true"></span>Aviva</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-fg-subtle">Unfiltered expert</p><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Direct, concise, unhedged. Fewer tokens by design. Facts without preamble.</p></article><article class="surface accent-edge [--edge:var(--wdbx)] p-7"><h3 class="flex items-center gap-2.5 font-display text-2xl"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-persona-abi" aria-hidden="true"></span>Abi</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-fg-subtle">Adaptive moderator</p><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Routes and blends. Classifies intent, applies policy, and reports what the ledger can prove.</p></article></div><p class="mt-6 text-sm text-fg-subtle">The Abbey CLI uses a different persona axis — Gemma interprets, Max implements — carried by prompts under fm and abi backends. Those are not distinct models and not a second product line.</p><div class="mt-4"><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2"><div><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 h-full"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">CLI persona</p><h3 class="font-display text-xl mt-1">Abbey</h3></div></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Care first. Scaffolded teaching, frustration detection, and a named uncertainty budget.</p></article></div><div><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 h-full"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">CLI persona</p><h3 class="font-display text-xl mt-1">Aviva</h3></div></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Clarity always. Strip hedges. Answer the question that was asked.</p></article></div><div><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 h-full"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">CLI persona</p><h3 class="font-display text-xl mt-1">Abi</h3></div></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Competence throughout. Route, blend, refuse, and leave a trace.</p></article></div></div></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Technical</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">Companion, ledger, refusal.</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-fg-muted sm:text-lg">The Abbey CLI/TUI is the companion that will not claim what the ledger cannot prove. WDBX is optional memory, off by default, with SQLite as the default store.</p></header><div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-5"><div class="surface p-4 text-center"><p class="font-display text-3xl tabular">18</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-fg-subtle">Current</p></div><div class="surface p-4 text-center"><p class="font-display text-3xl tabular">11</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-fg-subtle">Partial</p></div><div class="surface p-4 text-center"><p class="font-display text-3xl tabular">9</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-fg-subtle">Proposed</p></div><div class="surface p-4 text-center"><p class="font-display text-3xl tabular">4</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-fg-subtle">Blocked</p></div><div class="surface p-4 text-center"><p class="font-display text-3xl tabular">7</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-fg-subtle">Out of scope</p></div></div><p class="mt-4 mb-6 text-sm text-fg-muted">Enumerated with evidence in <code class="font-mono">abbey/src/claims.rs</code>, schema <!-- -->claims-v1<!-- -->, digest<!-- --> <code class="font-mono text-2xs break-all">reported from public tree — re-hash locally before citing</code>.<!-- --> <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold border-abi/30 bg-abi/8 text-abi ml-1 align-middle"><span aria-hidden="true">◆</span>Reported</span></p><div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="surface p-4 text-center"><p class="font-display text-3xl tabular">12</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-fg-subtle">Goals</p></div><div class="surface p-4 text-center"><p class="font-display text-3xl tabular">6</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-fg-subtle">Done</p></div><div class="surface p-4 text-center"><p class="font-display text-3xl tabular">14</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-fg-subtle">Checked todos</p></div><div class="surface p-4 text-center"><p class="font-display text-3xl tabular">8</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-fg-subtle">Open todos</p></div></div><p class="mt-4 mb-6 text-sm text-fg-subtle">Executable workflow ledger from <code class="font-mono">abbey workflow ledger</code>:<!-- --> <!-- -->6<!-- --> done, <!-- -->3<!-- --> in progress,<!-- --> <!-- -->5<!-- --> proposed, <!-- -->2<!-- --> blocked.<!-- --> <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold border-abi/30 bg-abi/8 text-abi ml-1 align-middle"><span aria-hidden="true">◆</span>Reported</span></p><dl class="surface divide-y divide-border overflow-hidden"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3"><dt class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Toolchain</dt><dd class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-sm text-fg tabular"><span>Rust nightly via repo wrappers</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3"><dt class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Backends</dt><dd class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-sm text-fg tabular"><span>SQLite (default) · WDBX (opt-in feature flag)</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3"><dt class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Default memory</dt><dd class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-sm text-fg tabular"><span>SQLite</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3"><dt class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">WDBX backend</dt><dd class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-sm text-fg tabular"><span>opt-in feature flag</span></dd></div></dl><div class="mt-6"><ul class="divide-y divide-border overflow-hidden rounded-xl shadow-border"><li class="bg-bg-elevated px-5 py-4"><p class="font-mono text-xs text-fg">abbey claims</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-fg-muted">Print the claims ledger. This is the source of status language.</p></li><li class="bg-bg-elevated px-5 py-4"><p class="font-mono text-xs text-fg">abbey memory search</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-fg-muted">Search local memory. Default store is SQLite.</p></li><li class="bg-bg-elevated px-5 py-4"><p class="font-mono text-xs text-fg">abbey persona</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-fg-muted">Show the active persona and the last routing reason.</p></li><li class="bg-bg-elevated px-5 py-4"><p class="font-mono text-xs text-fg">abbey workflow</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-fg-muted">Executable workflow ledger: goals, done, open, blocked.</p></li></ul></div><div class="mt-6"><div class="min-w-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-bg-elevated shadow-border"><div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border px-4 py-2"><span class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">donaldfilimon/abbey</span><button type="button" class="inline-flex h-9 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md px-2 text-2xs text-fg-muted hover:bg-bg-subtle hover:text-fg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-