-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-current" title="Present in public source and used as described."><span aria-hidden="true">●</span>Current</span><span class="text-sm text-fg-muted">Requires the sibling WDBX workspace.</span></div></div></div><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Responsibilities</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">What ABI actually does.</h2></header><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2"><div><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 [--edge:var(--abi)] h-full"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Model routing</h3></div><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-partial" title="Implemented in part. Scope is named on the page."><span aria-hidden="true">◐</span>Partial</span></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Exact registry model IDs and explicit device choice. Optional live providers behind stored credentials.</p></article></div><div><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 [--edge:var(--abi)] h-full"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Context management</h3></div><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-current" title="Present in public source and used as described."><span aria-hidden="true">●</span>Current</span></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Inspectable request context before a model or tool runs. Persistence records vectors and metadata only when the write succeeds.</p></article></div><div><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 [--edge:var(--abi)] h-full"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Safety boundaries</h3></div><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-partial" title="Implemented in part. Scope is named on the page."><span aria-hidden="true">◐</span>Partial</span></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Claim-honest reporting, plugin parity guards, bounded workers with finite leases and replay resistance (contracts).</p></article></div><div><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 [--edge:var(--abi)] h-full"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Tool orchestration</h3></div><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-current" title="Present in public source and used as described."><span aria-hidden="true">●</span>Current</span></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Twelve MCP tools in the public tree over stdio, plus an optional loopback HTTP+SSE listener. Not Streamable HTTP.</p></article></div><div><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 [--edge:var(--abi)] h-full"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Reasoning coordination</h3></div><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-partial" title="Implemented in part. Scope is named on the page."><span aria-hidden="true">◐</span>Partial</span></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Scheduler-backed helpers with live task and memory observability where the tree implements them.</p></article></div><div><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 [--edge:var(--abi)] h-full"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Memory integration</h3></div><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-current" title="Present in public source and used as described."><span aria-hidden="true">●</span>Current</span></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">WDBX is a required sibling. Skipping persistence never fabricates a successful write.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Public tree</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">Nightly Rust. Use the repo wrappers.</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-fg-muted sm:text-lg">Bare cargo is the wrong entry. ./tools/cargo.sh pins the toolchain the tree actually builds with.</p></header><div class="min-w-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-bg-elevated shadow-border"><div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border px-4 py-2"><span class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">donaldfilimon/abi</span><button type="button" class="inline-flex h-9 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md px-2 text-2xs text-fg-muted hover:bg-bg-subtle hover:text-fg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg>Copy</button></div><pre tabindex="0" class="max-w-full overflow-x-auto p-5 font-mono text-xs leading-7 text-fg"><code>git clone https://github.com/donaldfilimon/wdbx
