linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-moon absolute inset-0 size-4 transition-[opacity,transform,filter] duration-250 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] scale-100 opacity-100 blur-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.985 12.486a9 9 0 1 1-9.473-9.472c.405-.022.617.46.402.803a6 6 0 0 0 8.268 8.268c.344-.215.825-.004.803.401"></path></svg></span></button><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="inline-flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-md text-fg lg:hidden" data-overlay-trigger="menu"><span class="sr-only">Open menu</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-menu size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16"></path><path d="M4 12h16"></path><path d="M4 19h16"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main id="main" tabindex="-1" class="flex-1"><!--$--><div class="border-b border-border"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pt-16 pb-14 sm:px-6 sm:pt-24 sm:pb-20"><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1 class="mt-5 max-w-4xl font-display text-4xl leading-[1.02] tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">Safety before scale.</h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-[62ch] text-lg leading-8 text-fg-muted">Three voices, not one: Abbey for care, Aviva for clarity, Abi for competence. One substrate. Yours alone.</p></div></div><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Who we are</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">Rooted in research. Driven by reliability.</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-fg-muted sm:text-lg">MLAI is founder-led AI engineering work focused on assistant workflows, memory systems, and developer tools. Source references and implementation limits make the current work inspectable; proposed service engagements need project-specific acceptance criteria.</p></header><ul class="grid gap-3 font-mono text-sm text-accent sm:grid-cols-2"><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>Founder-led AI engineering</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>ABI runtime source in Rust</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>WDBX memory and retrieval source</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>Security assertions tied to implementation scope</li></ul></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Values</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">What the company is for.</h2></header><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2"><div><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 h-full"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Safety Before Scale</h3></div></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Our proposed engineering approach starts with bounded execution, explicit approvals, and failure criteria before expanding capability or throughput.</p></article></div><div><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 h-full"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Observable Reasoning</h3></div></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">We aim to expose provenance, retrieval context, decision checkpoints, and the operator actions that changed state. Each implementation needs its own evidence.</p></article></div><div><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 h-full"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Performance With Proof</h3></div></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Our evidence policy requires workload and environment notes for latency, recall, and GPU figures, and a reproduction record before calling them measured.</p></article></div><div><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 h-full"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Private Deployment Paths</h3></div></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Proposed deployment work starts by agreeing the data boundary and evaluating on-premise, VPC, hybrid, or edge requirements.</p></article></div><div><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 h-full"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Human-Centered Control</h3></div></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">We propose visible escalation, review, and override flows, with acceptance criteria agreed by the people responsible for the system.</p></article></div><div><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 h-full"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Research-To-Runtime Discipline</h3></div></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Research translation engagements propose integration notes, constraints, and operational guidance; a prototype needs separate release acceptance.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Our mission</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">Make assistant workflows inspectable.</h2></header><div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.2fr)_minmax(0,0.8fr)] lg:items-start"><p class="max-w-[66ch] text-lg leading-8 text-fg">Define the source, data boundary, tool permissions, and release evidence before expanding an assistant workflow. Research and prototypes require separate implementation and operational acceptance.</p><dl class="surface divide-y divide-border overflow-hidden"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3"><dt class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Service scope</dt><dd class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-sm text-fg tabular"><span>Proposed</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3"><dt class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Deployment boundary</dt><dd class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-sm text-fg tabular"><span>Agreed per project</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3"><dt class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Evidence</dt><dd class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-sm text-fg tabular"><span>Source and qualification</span></dd></div></dl></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Principles</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">Four lines we do not cross.</h2></header><ul class="grid gap-3 text-sm text-fg-muted sm:grid-cols-2"><li class="surface px-4 py-3">No autonomous write action without an observable policy boundary.</li><li class="surface px-4 py-3">No retrieval claim without a traceable source or confidence signal.</li><li class="surface px-4 py-3">No benchmark without environment notes, workload shape, and reproducibility context.</li><li class="surface px-4 py-3">No deployment plan that ignores rollback, incident review, and human escalation.</li></ul></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Thesis</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">Why on-device wins.</h2></header><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3"><div><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 h-full"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Define the data boundary</h3></div></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Evaluate where a workload may run, which data may leave the operator&#x27;s environment, and which obligations need separate legal review.</p></article></div><div><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 h-full"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Evaluate available hardware</h3></div></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Inspect the target device, runtime support, and workload before proposing local inference or acceleration.</p></article></div><div><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 h-full"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Measure the full operating cost</h3></div></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Compare hardware, energy, maintenance, and provider costs using an agreed workload; local execution alone does not establish unit economics.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Entity</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">Registration-level facts.</h2></header><dl class="surface divide-y divide-border overflow-hidden"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3"><dt class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Brand</dt><dd class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-sm text-fg tabular"><span>MLAI</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3"><dt class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Focus</dt><dd class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-sm text-fg tabular"><span>Founder-led AI engineering</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3"><dt class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Languages</dt><dd class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-sm text-fg tabular"><span>Rust, Swift, TypeScript</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3"><dt class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Model</dt><dd class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-sm text-fg tabular"><span>Proposed SDK licensing + integration services</span></dd></div></dl></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6"><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border border-transparent font-medium whitespace-nowrap no-underline transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow,opacity,transform] duration-150 ease-out select-none focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:not-disabled:translate-y-px bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/80 h-11 rounded-md px-4 text-sm" href="/contact">Start an inquiry</a><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border font-medium whitespace-nowrap no-underline transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow,opacity,transform] duration-150 ease-out select-none focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:not-disabled:translate-y-px border-border bg-card/80 text-foreground hover:bg-muted h-11 rounded-md px-4 text-sm" href="/company">Company</a><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border font-medium whitespace-nowrap no-underline transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow,opacity,transform] duration-150 ease-out select-none focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:not-disabled:translate-y-px border-border bg-card/80 text-foreground hover:bg-muted h-11 rounded-md px-4 text-sm" href="/team">Team</a><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border font-medium whitespace-nowrap no-underline transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow,opacity,transform] duration-150 ease-out select-none focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50