tatus-current" aria-hidden="true"></span>Local project scaffold and preview</li></ul></div><div data-orientation="horizontal" role="none" class="shrink-0 bg-border h-px w-full my-5"></div><div class="mt-0"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Not claimed</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-1.5"><li class="flex gap-2 text-sm text-fg-muted"><span class="mt-1.5 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-border-strong" aria-hidden="true"></span>A trained Quesar foundation model</li><li class="flex gap-2 text-sm text-fg-muted"><span class="mt-1.5 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-border-strong" aria-hidden="true"></span>Live provider generation acceptance</li></ul></div><p class="mt-5 text-xs text-fg-subtle">Arrow keys move between nodes</p><div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border border-transparent font-medium whitespace-nowrap no-underline transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow,opacity,transform] duration-150 ease-out select-none focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:not-disabled:translate-y-px bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/80 h-11 rounded-md px-4 text-sm" href="/console?node=quesar">Save a field note</a><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border border-transparent font-medium whitespace-nowrap no-underline transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow,opacity,transform] duration-150 ease-out select-none focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:not-disabled:translate-y-px bg-transparent text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted hover:text-foreground h-11 rounded-md px-4 text-sm" href="/quesar">Read the <!-- -->Quesar<!-- --> page</a><button type="button" class="inline-flex h-11 items-center px-3 text-sm font-medium text-fg-muted hover:text-fg" data-state="closed">Copy node link</button></div></aside></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Reading the diagram</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">Input, processing, memory, retrieval, execution, tools, output.</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-fg-muted sm:text-lg">The layers are a map, not a marketing stack. If a name sounds larger than the implementation, the status label is the correction.</p></header><ol class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2"><li class="surface flex gap-4 p-5"><span class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-bg font-mono text-2xs text-accent shadow-border">01</span><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">User → Quesar</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">For the experimental website builder, the browser pairs with an operator-owned Quasar service. Generation requires separate provider configuration.</p></div></li><li class="surface flex gap-4 p-5"><span class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-bg font-mono text-2xs text-accent shadow-border">02</span><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">ABI + tools: a separate integration path</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">ABI&#x27;s inspected sources provide deterministic persona routing and MCP tools. The Quasar builder does not establish an integration with ABI.</p></div></li><li class="surface flex gap-4 p-5"><span class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-bg font-mono text-2xs text-accent shadow-border">03</span><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Persona routing and completion</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">The inspected local router selects a persona profile; template completion does not establish execution of a registry model on a selected device.</p></div></li><li class="surface flex gap-4 p-5"><span class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-bg font-mono text-2xs text-accent shadow-border">04</span><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">WDBX</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">WDBX implements durable records, vector retrieval, and structural provenance. Evidence-weighted retrieval remains unimplemented.</p></div></li><li class="surface flex gap-4 p-5"><span class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-bg font-mono text-2xs text-accent shadow-border">05</span><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Local / edge / remote compute</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">The compute substrate provides CPU vector operations. Separately, configured website model requests and Quasar generation can send content to model providers.</p></div></li><li class="surface flex gap-4 p-5"><span class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-bg font-mono text-2xs text-accent shadow-border">06</span><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Output</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">A response, a plan, a tool result, or a refusal. Abbey will not claim what the ledger cannot prove.</p></div></li></ol></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6"><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border border-transparent font-medium whitespace-nowrap no-underline transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow,opacity,transform] duration-150 ease-out select-none focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:not-disabled:translate-y-px bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/80 h-11 rounded-md px-4 text-sm" href="/developers">Developers</a><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border font-medium whitespace-nowrap no-underline transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow,opacity,transform] duration-150 ease-out select-none focus-v