svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-moon absolute inset-0 size-4 transition-[opacity,transform,filter] duration-250 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1)] scale-100 opacity-100 blur-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.985 12.486a9 9 0 1 1-9.473-9.472c.405-.022.617.46.402.803a6 6 0 0 0 8.268 8.268c.344-.215.825-.004.803.401"></path></svg></span></button><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="inline-flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-md text-fg lg:hidden" data-overlay-trigger="menu"><span class="sr-only">Open menu</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-menu size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16"></path><path d="M4 12h16"></path><path d="M4 19h16"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main id="main" tabindex="-1" class="flex-1"><!--$--><div class="border-b border-border"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pt-16 pb-14 sm:px-6 sm:pt-24 sm:pb-20"><p class="eyebrow">Company</p><h1 class="mt-5 max-w-4xl font-display text-4xl leading-[1.02] tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">Engineering with explicit boundaries.</h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-[62ch] text-lg leading-8 text-fg-muted">MLAI is led by founder and systems architect Donald Filimon. Explore the engineering principles behind the services and the source behind the products.</p></div></div><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><p class="max-w-3xl text-base leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Discuss a project to define its scope, data boundaries, and evidence requirements.</p><a href="https://github.com/donaldfilimon/quesar.cloud/blob/f3ccc082f72ef868ca3c3a60f332f7efe9cfe492/src/lib/mlai/categories/team.ts" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="mt-4 inline-block text-sm text-accent underline underline-offset-4">Inspect the source behind this page</a></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Company</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">Who develops this.</h2></header><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2"><article class="surface accent-edge p-6"><h3 class="font-display text-xl">MLAI</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">MLAI is the company brand used on this site. Its public pages provide orientation and source references.</p></article><article class="surface accent-edge p-6"><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Donald Filimon</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Founder and systems architect. Public work spans Rust, Swift, and TypeScript — ABI, WDBX, Abbey, Gama, and the company site. Motto used in internal docs: care first, clarity always, competence throughout.</p><ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-fg-muted"><li class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span>Source references: ABI, WDBX, Abbey, Gama, and this site; not deployment acceptance</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold border-abi/30 bg-abi/8 text-abi"><span aria-hidden="true">◆</span>Reported</span></li><li class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span>Abbey source includes a capability ledger in src/claims.rs; not a model-quality result</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold border-abi/30 bg-abi/8 text-abi"><span aria-hidden="true">◆</span>Reported</span></li><li class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span>Proposed acceptance: repeatable verification for each deployment and device</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold border-warn/35 bg-warn/8 text-warn"><span aria-hidden="true">○</span>Target</span></li></ul></article></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Origin</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">Why three, not one.</h2></header><blockquote class="pull-quote text-fg">Three voices, not one: Abbey for care, Aviva for clarity, Abi for competence. One substrate. Yours alone.</blockquote></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Integrity</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">Rules that cost more to break than any asset.</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-fg-muted sm:text-lg">These are the site&#x27;s integrity rules. Licensing statements refer to the named repository licenses; figures require a source and provenance tag.</p></header><ul class="grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2"><li class="surface p-4"><p class="text-xs text-accent">Apple sentence</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">The only approved Apple sentence is the one on this site. Do not invent affiliation, endorsement, or silicon partnership.</p></li><li class="surface p-4"><p class="text-xs text-accent">Provenance tags</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Figures are measured, target, or reported. A target is never a result. Missing a tag is a defect.</p></li><li class="surface p-4"><p class="text-xs text-accent">Apache-2.0</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">ABI and WDBX each include an Apache-2.0 LICENSE in their inspected source revisions. Check the named repository license before reusing its code.</p></li><li class="surface p-4"><p class="text-xs text-accent">Toolchain facts</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">ABI is nightly Rust. Follow each repository README. Do not mix Zig-era claims into the current tree.</p></li><li class="surface p-4"><p class="text-xs text-accent">WDBX unexpanded</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Do not invent recall, QPS, or latency numbers. Graph defaults are configuration, not a scoreboard.</p></li><li class="surface p-4"><p class="text-xs text-accent">No borrowed benchmarks</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Site policy: publish a figure only with a named source artifact and a provenance tag. A source report is not an independently reproduced measurement.</p></li></ul></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Status labels</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">Labels are not interchangeable.</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-fg-muted sm:text-lg">Current, Partial, Experimental, In development, Planned, and Research mean different things across this site. Planned functionality is never presented as shipping. Figures carry a separate provenance tag.</p></header><ul class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><li class="surface p-5"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-current" title="Present in public source and used as described."><span aria-hidden="true">●</span>Current</span><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Present in public source and used as described.</p></li><li class="surface p-5"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-partial" title="Implemented in part. Scope is named on the page."><span aria-hidden="true">◐</span>Partial</span><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Implemented in part. Scope is named on the page.</p></li><li class="surface p-5"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-partial" title="Runnable or inspectable, not a product claim."><span aria-hidden="true">◌</span>Experimental</span><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Runnable or inspectable, not a product claim.</p></li><li class="surface p-5"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-partial" title="Actively changing. Do not treat as stable."><span aria-hidden="true">◦</span>In development</span><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Actively changing. Do not treat as stable.</p></li><li class="surface p-5"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-planned" title="Intent. Never presented as shipping."><span aria-hidden="true">○</span>Planned</span><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Intent. Never presented as shipping.</p></li><li class="surface p-5"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-planned" title="Founder or lab work. Not a Quesar product surface."><span aria-hidden="true">◆</span>Research</span><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Founder or lab work. Not a Quesar product surface.</p></li></ul><dl class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-5 gap-y-2 text-xs text-fg-muted mt-8" aria-label="How figures on this site are labeled"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><dt><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold border-abbey/30 bg-abbey/8 text-abbey"><span aria-hidden="true">●</span>Measured</span></dt><dd>Present in source, reproduced locally, or a configuration fact.</dd></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><dt><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold border-warn/35 bg-warn/8 text-warn"><span aria-hidden="true">○</span>Target</span></dt><dd>Engineering goal. Never a result.</dd></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><dt><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold border-abi/30 bg-abi/8 text-abi"><span aria-hidden="true">◆</span>Reported</span></dt><dd>Cited from a named source. Not re-measured here.</dd></div></dl></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">Short answers.