ef="/docs/runtime">ABI Runtime</a></li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Security &amp; trust</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-0.5"><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/trust">Security &amp; trust</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/evidence">Evidence</a></li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Systems</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-0.5"><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/identity">Identity</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/gama">Gama</a></li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Architecture</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-0.5"><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/personas">Persona Routing</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/wdbx">WDBX Retrieval</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/wdbx-v2">WDBX V2 Docs</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/mcp">MCP Server</a></li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Operations</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-0.5"><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/deployment">Deployment</a></li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Reference</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-0.5"><li><a aria-current="page" class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors bg-primary/10 text-fg active" href="/docs/api" data-status="active">Protected API</a></li></ul></div></nav><div><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-10"><article><h2 id="what-this-site-actually-exposes" class="scroll-mt-24 font-display text-[1.65rem] leading-tight tracking-tight text-fg">What this site actually exposes</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-8 text-fg">Sign-in opens /console: per-user field notes on architecture nodes, a consent-gated model chat, and the sealed audits of that chat. Model replies are sign-in-gated, rate-limited per user, and not an Abbey session.</p><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-8 text-fg">Every per-user server function runs behind the session middleware and scopes its queries by the signed-in user id, never an id sent by the browser. Without a session the console redirects to sign-in. On the static GitHub Pages build these surfaces render a server-only notice instead.</p><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-8 text-fg">The surfaces below are everything the server exposes. There is no hosted assistant API and no platform SDK.</p></article><ul class="mt-8 space-y-3"><li class="surface p-4"><a class="text-sm font-medium text-accent no-underline hover:underline" href="/developers">quesar.cloud repository rules</a><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-fg-muted">This site&#x27;s own auth, admin, encryption and configuration decisions.</p></li><li class="surface p-4"><a class="text-sm font-medium text-accent no-underline hover:underline" href="/abi">External claims audit</a><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-fg-muted">Further reading linked by the ABI README; not separately audited here.</p></li></ul><p class="mt-4 text-xs text-fg-subtle">Checked against these sources on<!-- --> <time dateTime="2026-09-29">2026-09-29</time>.</p></div><section id="what-this-site-exposes" aria-labelledby="what-this-site-exposes-title" class="mt-16 scroll-mt-28"><p class="text-xs text-accent">Reference</p><h2 id="what-this-site-exposes-title" class="mt-2 font-display text-2xl tracking-tight">What this site exposes</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Protected surfaces require a Better Auth session and fail closed. There is no public hosted assistant API.</p><div class="mt-6"><ul class="grid gap-3"><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-fg">/api/auth/*</p><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-current" title="Present in public source and used as described."><span aria-hidden="true">●</span>Current</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-fg-muted">Better Auth: Google, Apple and X sign-in, passkeys, email and password, session.</p></article></li><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-fg">askPersona</p><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-current" title="Present in public source and used as described."><span aria-hidden="true">●</span>Current</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-fg-muted">Server function behind the session: one persona reply through the model interface, rate-limited per user.</p></article></li><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-fg">askDesk</p><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-current" title="Present in public source and used as described."><span aria-hidden="true">●</span>Current</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-fg-muted">Server function behind the session: a desk answer from the catalog and, when configured, the model.</p></article></li><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-fg">Console notes</p><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-current" title="Present in public source and used as described."><span aria-hidden="true">●</span>Current</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-fg-muted">Per-user field notes on architecture nodes, scoped by user id.</p></article></li><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-fg">GET /feed.xml</p><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-current" title="Present in public source and used as described."><span aria-hidden="true">●</span>Current</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-fg-muted">RSS 2.0 for lab notes, research publications and releases. Public.</p></article></li><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-fg">POST /api/telemetry, POST /api/csp-report</p><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-current" title="Present in public source and used as described."><span aria-hidden="true">●</span>Current</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-fg-muted">Operational sinks: allowlisted anonymous page events (rate-limited, size-limited) and browser CSP violation reports (logged, not stored).</p></article></li><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-fg">GET /api/cron/audits-expire</p><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-current" title="Present in public source and used as described."><span aria-hidden="true">●</span>Current</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-fg-muted">Daily expiry of old chat audits. Requires Authorization: Bearer CRON_SECRET; without the secret it answers 503 and is off.</p></article></li><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-fg">Consent, audits, admin review</p><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-current" title="Present in public source and used as described."><span aria-hidden="true">●</span>Current</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-fg-muted">Consent-gated chat with sealed audits you can read and delete; admin review with a stated reason.</p></article></li><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-fg">Workspace connectors, billing, inquiries</p><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-current" title="Present in public source and used as described."><span aria-hidden="true">●</span>Current</span></div><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-fg-muted">Drive and SharePoint connectors, profile billing, and the public inquiry form with a rate limit.</p></article></li></ul></div></section><div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm"><a class="text-accent active" href="/docs" data-status="active" aria-current="page">All docs</a><a class="text-fg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/deployment">Previous: Each surface has its own gate.</a></div></div><nav aria-label="On this page" class="mt-8 hidden xl:block"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">On this page</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-1"><li><a href="#what-this-site-actually-exposes" class="text-sm text-fg-muted no-underline hover:text-fg">What this site actually exposes</a></li><li><a href="#what-this-site-exposes" class="text-sm text-fg-muted no-underline hover:text-fg">What this site exposes</a></li></ul></nav></div></section><sect