page" class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors bg-primary/10 text-fg active" href="/docs/deployment" data-status="active">Deployment</a></li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Reference</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-0.5"><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/api">Protected API</a></li></ul></div></nav><div><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-10"><article><h2 id="independent-gates" class="scroll-mt-24 font-display text-[1.65rem] leading-tight tracking-tight text-fg">Independent gates</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-8 text-fg">Run each check in the source tree it covers. The website gate does not validate its standalone sidecars, the separate Abbey app, native devices, or the ABI and WDBX workspaces.</p><ul class="mt-5 max-w-[66ch] space-y-3"><li class="flex gap-3 text-base leading-8 text-fg"><span class="mt-3 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary" aria-hidden="true"></span>bun run check — this website, from the repository root; bun run build:static prepares the GitHub Pages artifact</li><li class="flex gap-3 text-base leading-8 text-fg"><span class="mt-3 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary" aria-hidden="true"></span>bun run test and bun run typecheck — local Quasar service, from sidecars/quasar-service</li><li class="flex gap-3 text-base leading-8 text-fg"><span class="mt-3 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary" aria-hidden="true"></span>Abbey workspace — follow the separate app&#x27;s current README; the browser page here is only a preview</li><li class="flex gap-3 text-base leading-8 text-fg"><span class="mt-3 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary" aria-hidden="true"></span>Mobile and native — the web vault is a preview; Android sync and signed-device checks are separate</li><li class="flex gap-3 text-base leading-8 text-fg"><span class="mt-3 size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-primary" aria-hidden="true"></span>./tools/check.sh — ABI checkout with its sibling WDBX workspace</li></ul></article><article><h2 id="targets" class="scroll-mt-24 font-display text-[1.65rem] leading-tight tracking-tight text-fg">Targets</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-8 text-fg">Default posture is operator-owned machines. VPC, on-premise, hybrid, and offline-first paths are the design. This website does not provision hosting, deploy adapters, or bill. Configuring quesar.cloud itself is covered below.</p></article><ul class="mt-8 space-y-3"><li class="surface p-4"><a class="text-sm font-medium text-accent no-underline hover:underline" href="/developers">quesar.cloud repository rules</a><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-fg-muted">This site&#x27;s own auth, admin, encryption and configuration decisions.</p></li><li class="surface p-4"><a class="text-sm font-medium text-accent no-underline hover:underline" href="/abi">ABI README</a><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-fg-muted">Source description, tool commands and stated limitations; not a reproduced test run.</p></li></ul><p class="mt-4 text-xs text-fg-subtle">Checked against these sources on<!-- --> <time dateTime="2026-09-29">2026-09-29</time>.</p></div><section id="configuring-this-site" aria-labelledby="configuring-this-site-title" class="mt-16 scroll-mt-28"><p class="text-xs text-accent">Operations</p><h2 id="configuring-this-site-title" class="mt-2 font-display text-2xl tracking-tight">Configuring this site</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">For quesar.cloud itself. Each missing value produces a clear &quot;not configured&quot; state, never a crash.</p><div class="mt-6"><ol class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2"><li class="surface flex gap-4 p-5"><span class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-bg font-mono text-2xs text-accent shadow-border">01</span><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Database</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Set DATABASE_URL for Postgres. Without it the app runs on in-memory PGLite, and data does not survive a restart or a serverless instance.</p></div></li><li class="surface flex gap-4 p-5"><span class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-bg font-mono text-2xs text-accent shadow-border">02</span><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Encryption key</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Set APP_ENCRYPTION_KEY (32 bytes, openssl rand -base64 32). Without it, sealed features refuse instead of storing plaintext.</p></div></li><li class="surface flex gap-4 p-5"><span class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-bg font-mono text-2xs text-accent shadow-border">03</span><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Server-only provider keys</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Set XAI_API_KEY, or the Cloudflare AI Gateway URL, token and id, plus LLM_PROVIDER. Never expose them to browser bundles.</p></div></li><li class="surface flex gap-4 p-5"><span class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-bg font-mono text-2xs text-accent shadow-border">04</span><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Administrators</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Set ADMIN_EMAILS. Only an allowlisted address with a linked Google or Apple account becomes an admin.</p></div></li><li class="surface flex gap-4 p-5"><span class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-bg font-mono text-2xs text-accent shadow-border">05</span><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Evaluation gates</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Run evaluation gates before allowing autonomous write actions or external tool calls.</p></div></li></ol></div></section><div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm"><a class="text-accent active" href="/docs" data-status="active" aria-current="page">All docs</a><a class="text-fg-muted