"M4 19h16"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main id="main" tabindex="-1" class="flex-1"><!--$--><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="border-b border-border"><ol class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 px-4 py-3 text-sm sm:px-6"><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><a class="text-fg-muted no-underline hover:text-fg active" href="/docs" data-status="active" aria-current="page">Docs</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-fg-subtle">/</span><span class="text-fg" aria-current="page">Twelve contract-covered tools.</span></li></ol></nav><div class="border-b border-border"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 sm:py-14"><p class="eyebrow">Architecture</p><h1 class="mt-3 max-w-4xl font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-4xl">Twelve contract-covered tools.</h1><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-7 text-fg-muted">JSON-RPC 2.0 over stdio, optional loopback HTTP. Unknown tools fail closed.</p></div></div><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28 !pt-8"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[16rem_minmax(0,1fr)] xl:grid-cols-[16rem_minmax(0,1fr)_14rem]"><nav aria-label="Docs" class="lg:sticky lg:top-24 lg:max-h-[calc(100dvh-7rem)] lg:overflow-y-auto"><div class="mb-6"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Start</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-0.5"><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/getting-started">Introduction</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/architecture">Roles</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/runtime">ABI Runtime</a></li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Security &amp; trust</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-0.5"><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/trust">Security &amp; trust</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/evidence">Evidence</a></li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Systems</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-0.5"><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/identity">Identity</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/gama">Gama</a></li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Architecture</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-0.5"><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/personas">Persona Routing</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/wdbx">WDBX Retrieval</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/wdbx-v2">WDBX V2 Docs</a></li><li><a aria-current="page" class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors bg-primary/10 text-fg active" href="/docs/mcp" data-status="active">MCP Server</a></li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Operations</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-0.5"><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/deployment">Deployment</a></li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Reference</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-0.5"><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/api">Protected API</a></li></ul></div></nav><div><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-10"><article><h2 id="what-you-can-call-locally" class="scroll-mt-24 font-display text-[1.65rem] leading-tight tracking-tight text-fg">What you can call locally</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-8 text-fg">The MCP server lives in the ABI repository. stdio is the primary transport; an optional loopback HTTP listener with bearer auth serves MCP 2024-11-05 HTTP+SSE sessions. This website does not expose those tools to visitors.</p><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-8 text-fg">Twelve tools are contract-covered. They are listed with their transport details in the MCP server reference below, taken from the same catalog the /abi page uses.</p></article><article><h2 id="what-is-not-published" class="scroll-mt-24 font-display text-[1.65rem] leading-tight tracking-tight text-fg">What is not published</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-8 text-fg">There is no hosted Quesar HTTP API, no third-party SaaS SDK, and no guaranteed stable versioning across all crates. A local site-builder HTTP API exists on a trusted LAN without authentication — run it only on a network you trust.</p></article><ul class="mt-8 space-y-3"><li class="surface p-4"><a class="text-sm font-medium text-accent no-underline hover:underline" href="/abi">ABI README</a><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-fg-muted">Source description, tool commands and stated limitations; not a reproduced test run.</p></li></ul><p class="mt-4 text-xs text-fg-subtle">Checked against these sources on<!-- --> <time dateTime="2026-09-29">2026-09-29</time>.</p></div><section id="mcp-server" aria-labelledby="mcp-server-title" class="mt-16 scroll-mt-28"><p class="text-xs text-accent">Architecture</p><h2 id="mcp-server-title" class="mt-2 font-display text-2xl tracking-tight">MCP server</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">The abi-mcp server speaks JSON-RPC 2.0 over stdio. Its optional loopback HTTP compatibility listener serves persistent MCP 2024-11-05 HTTP+SSE sessions; it is not Streamable HTTP. Tool names and transport facts are from the ABI README.</p><div class="mt-6"><dl class="surface divide-y divide-border overflow-hidden"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3"><dt class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Transport</dt><dd class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-sm text-fg tabular"><span>JSON-RPC 2.0 over stdio</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3"><dt class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Request cap</dt><dd class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-sm text-fg tabular"><span>64 KB</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3"><dt class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Loopback HTTP listener</dt><dd class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-sm text-fg tabular"><span>127.0.0.1:8080 (optional)</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3"><dt class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Port override</dt><dd class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-sm text-fg tabular"><span>ABI_MCP_HTTP_PORT</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3"><dt class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Bearer auth</dt><dd class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-sm text-fg tabular"><span>ABI_MCP_HTTP_TOKEN (optional)</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3"><dt class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Session stream</dt><dd class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-sm text-fg tabular"><span>GET /sse: persistent MCP 2024-11-05 HTTP+SSE session</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3"><dt class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Message endpoint</dt><dd class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-sm text-fg tabular"><span>POST /message; without a sessionId, one-shot direct reply</span></dd></div></dl><h3 class="mt-8 font-display text-lg">Tools</h3><div class="mt-4"><ul class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-6"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">ai_learn</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Learning entry point with local side effects; ABI_WDBX_PERSIST=0 disables persistence.</p></article></li><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-6"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">scheduler_info</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Compatibility alias for scheduler statistics.</p></article></li><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-6"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">ai_complete</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Local template completion through the routed persona profile; the requested model id is metadata, not proof it ran.</p></article></li><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-6"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">ai_run</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Run completion with local profile routing.</p></article></li><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-6"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">ai_train</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Train the selected local profile against WDBX.</p></article></li><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-6"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">wdbx_query</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Vector / block retrieval against the WDBX store with ordered results.</p></article></li><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-6"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">wdbx_stats</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Report local WDBX store statistics; not a cluster dashboard.</p></article></li><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-6"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">gpu_status</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Report GPU capability and backend, with deterministic CPU fallback.</p></article></li><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-6"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">scheduler_stats</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Report scheduler task counts.</p></article></li><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-6"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">connector_test</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Run local connector validation; does not prove live credentials work.</p></article></li><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-6"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">plugin_list</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Enumerate registered plugins and their target features.</p></article></li><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-6"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">plugin_run</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Invoke a registered plugin entry point.</p></article></li></ul></div></div></section><div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm"><a class="text-accent active" href="/docs" data-status="active" aria-current="page">All docs</a><a class="text-fg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/wdbx-v2">Previous: The V2 snapshot, kept for reference.</a><a class="text-fg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/deployment">Next: Each surface has its own gate.</a></div></div><nav aria-label="On this page" class="mt-8 hidden xl:block"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">On this page</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-1"><li><a href="#what-you-can-call-locally" class="text-sm text-fg-muted no-underline hover:text-fg">What you can call locally</a></li><li><a href="#what-is-not-published" class="text-sm text-fg-muted no-underline hover:text-fg">What is not published</a></li><li><a href="#mcp-server" class="text-sm text-fg-muted no-underline hover:text-fg">MCP server</a></li></ul></nav></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6"><di