derline transition-colors bg-primary/10 text-fg active" href="/docs/runtime" data-status="active">ABI Runtime</a></li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Security &amp; trust</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-0.5"><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/trust">Security &amp; trust</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/evidence">Evidence</a></li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Systems</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-0.5"><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/identity">Identity</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/gama">Gama</a></li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Architecture</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-0.5"><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/personas">Persona Routing</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/wdbx">WDBX Retrieval</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/wdbx-v2">WDBX V2 Docs</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/mcp">MCP Server</a></li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Operations</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-0.5"><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/deployment">Deployment</a></li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Reference</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-0.5"><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/api">Protected API</a></li></ul></div></nav><div><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-10"><article><h2 id="use-the-wrappers" class="scroll-mt-24 font-display text-[1.65rem] leading-tight tracking-tight text-fg">Use the wrappers</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-8 text-fg">The public ABI tree is nightly Rust. Bare cargo is the wrong entry. ./tools/cargo.sh pins the toolchain the tree actually builds with. ./tools/check.sh is the primary validation gate.</p><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-8 text-fg">WDBX is a required sibling. Clone both workspaces. A successful gate is evidence for that checkout and environment, not for a hosted product or a foundation-model quality claim.</p><div class="mt-4"><div class="min-w-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-bg-elevated shadow-border"><div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border px-4 py-2"><span class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">donaldfilimon/abi</span><button type="button" class="inline-flex h-9 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md px-2 text-2xs text-fg-muted hover:bg-bg-subtle hover:text-fg"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg>Copy</button></div><pre tabindex="0" class="max-w-full overflow-x-auto p-5 font-mono text-xs leading-7 text-fg"><code>git clone https://github.com/donaldfilimon/wdbx
 git clone https://github.com/donaldfilimon/abi
 cd abi
 ./tools/cargo.sh --version
@@ -11,4 +11,4 @@ cd abi
 # Inspect capabilities and terminal surfaces
 ./target/debug/abi backends
