-./target/debug/abi agent tui</code></pre></div><div class="mt-6 grid gap-6"><dl class="surface divide-y divide-border overflow-hidden"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3"><dt class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Runtime</dt><dd class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-sm text-fg tabular"><span>Rust workspace: AI, WDBX, GPU, MCP, terminal</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3"><dt class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Configuration</dt><dd class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-sm text-fg tabular"><span>Crate-specific Cargo features</span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 px-5 py-3"><dt class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Capability inspection</dt><dd class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-sm text-fg tabular"><span>abi backends · abi wdbx gpu info</span></dd></div></dl><ul class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-6"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">abi-ai</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Profile routing, completion, and governance helpers.</p></article></li><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-6"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">abi-sea</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Evidence selection, scoring, and learning loop.</p></article></li><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-6"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">abi-wdbx</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Durable memory and retrieval from the sibling Rust substrate.</p></article></li><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-6"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">abi-gpu</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Backend reporting, optional Metal DOT kernels, and CPU fallback.</p></article></li><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-6"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">abi-mcp</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">JSON-RPC tool handlers and stdio server.</p></article></li><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-6"><p class="font-mono text-sm text-accent">abi-cli</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Commands, agent REPL, and diagnostics dashboard.</p></article></li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-8 font-display text-lg">Design decisions</h3><div class="mt-4"><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3"><div><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 h-full"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Inspectable capabilities</h3></div></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Report the selected backend and whether acceleration is active. Capability detection alone is not evidence of accelerated execution.</p></article></div><div><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 h-full"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Bounded evidence</h3></div></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">SEA selects evidence within record, token, cluster, and prompt-byte budgets. Retrieval is distinct from model training.</p></article></div><div><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 h-full"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Explicit runtime boundaries</h3></div></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Local completion is deterministic persona-template generation. Live HTTP completion requires an explicitly configured provider.</p></article></div></div></div></div></section><div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm"><a class="text-accent active" href="/docs" data-status="active" aria-current="page">All docs</a><a class="text-fg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/architecture">Previous: Different tools. Clear roles.</a><a class="text-fg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/trust">Next: Fail closed. Tag the figure.</a></div></div><nav aria-label="On this page" class="mt-8 hidden xl:block"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">On this page</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-1"><li><a href="#use-t