ecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-menu size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16"></path><path d="M4 12h16"></path><path d="M4 19h16"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main id="main" tabindex="-1" class="flex-1"><!--$--><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="border-b border-border"><ol class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 px-4 py-3 text-sm sm:px-6"><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><a class="text-fg-muted no-underline hover:text-fg active" href="/docs" data-status="active" aria-current="page">Docs</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-fg-subtle">/</span><span class="text-fg" aria-current="page">Memory is a substrate, not a chat log.</span></li></ol></nav><div class="border-b border-border"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 sm:py-14"><p class="eyebrow">Architecture</p><h1 class="mt-3 max-w-4xl font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-4xl">Memory is a substrate, not a chat log.</h1><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-7 text-fg-muted">Layered HNSW, MVCC, content addressing. Integrity of storage is not truth of the record.</p></div></div><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28 !pt-8"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[16rem_minmax(0,1fr)] xl:grid-cols-[16rem_minmax(0,1fr)_14rem]"><nav aria-label="Docs" class="lg:sticky lg:top-24 lg:max-h-[calc(100dvh-7rem)] lg:overflow-y-auto"><div class="mb-6"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Start</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-0.5"><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/getting-started">Introduction</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/architecture">Roles</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/runtime">ABI Runtime</a></li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Security &amp; trust</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-0.5"><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/trust">Security &amp; trust</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/evidence">Evidence</a></li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Systems</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-0.5"><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/identity">Identity</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/gama">Gama</a></li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Architecture</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-0.5"><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/personas">Persona Routing</a></li><li><a aria-current="page" class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors bg-primary/10 text-fg active" href="/docs/wdbx" data-status="active">WDBX Retrieval</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/wdbx-v2">WDBX V2 Docs</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/mcp">MCP Server</a></li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Operations</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-0.5"><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/deployment">Deployment</a></li></ul></div><div class="mb-6"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Reference</p><ul class="mt-2 space-y-0.5"><li><a class="flex min-h-11 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/docs/api">Protected API</a></li></ul></div></nav><div><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-10"><article><h2 id="configuration-facts" class="scroll-mt-24 font-display text-[1.65rem] leading-tight tracking-tight text-fg">Configuration facts</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-8 text-fg">The active substrate is the Rust tree extracted from donaldfilimon/abi on 2026-08-22 with history preserved. Crate names keep the abi- prefix deliberately. ABI owns this layer.</p><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-8 text-fg">Engine: Layered HNSW. Concurrency: MVCC. M=16, EF_CONSTRUCTION=40, EF_SEARCH=32, cosine metric, content-addressed. Sharding is not established.</p></article><article><h2 id="what-it-does-not-prove" class="scroll-mt-24 font-display text-[1.65rem] leading-tight tracking-tight text-fg">What it does not prove</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-8 text-fg">Storage integrity does not prove the truth of stored statements. Signatures and causal history answer why a record is trusted. Hybrid ranking currently collapses several axes into one score — that is a documented limitation, not a product claim.</p><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-8 text-fg">Reference cluster replication exists in source. It does not establish production multi-host operation.</p></article><ul class="mt-8 space-y-3"><li class="surface p-4"><a class="text-sm font-medium text-accent no-underline hover:underline" href="/wdbx">WDBX substrate</a><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-fg-muted">Rust substrate README. Configuration facts, not a hosted database or a recall scoreboard.</p></li><li class="surface p-4"><a class="text-sm font-medium text-accent no-underline hover:underline" href="/abi">ABI README</a><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-fg-muted">Source description, tool commands and stated limitations; not a reproduced test run.</p></li></ul><p class="mt-4 text-xs text-fg-subtle">Checked against these sources on<!-- --> <time dateTime="2026-09-29">2026-09-29</time>.</p></div><section id="wdbx-retrieval" aria-labelledby="wdbx-retrieval-title" class="mt-16 scroll-mt-28"><p class="text-xs text-accent">Architecture</p><h2 id="wdbx-retrieval-title" class="mt-2 font-display text-2xl tracking-tight">WDBX retrieval</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">WDBX is the Weighted Directed Backtrace eXecution store. It keeps context as weighted paths so retrieval can be inspected, not just ranked: key-value, vector, and block surfaces, with snapshot persistence guarded by SHA-256 integrity checks.</p><div class="mt-6"><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2"><div><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 h-full"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Weighted backtrace paths</h3></div><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-partial" title="Implemented in part. Scope is named on the page."><span aria-hidden="true">◐</span>Partial</span></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Hybrid retrieval exposes its score components. The score still collapses several axes; separate evidence-weighted ranking is planned.</p></article></div><div><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 h-full"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">HNSW vector search</h3></div><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-current" title="Present in public source and used as described."><span aria-hidden="true">●</span>Current</span></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Cosine nearest-neighbor through the active Rust substrate&#x27;s layered HNSW index (M=16, EF_CONSTRUCTION=40, EF_SEARCH=32).</p></article></div><div><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 h-full"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Durable snapshots</h3></div><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-current" title="Present in public source and used as described."><span aria-hidden="true">●</span>Current</span></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Snapshots with CRC-framed WAL recovery and checkpoints. Snapshot-chain and strict content verification are separate checks.</p></article></div><div><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 h-full"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Switchable persistence</h3></div><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-current" title="Present in public source and used as described."><span aria-hidden="true">●</span>Current</span></div><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">The local store defaults to $HOME/.abi/wdbx; ABI_WDBX_PERSIST=0 disables persistence for evaluation runs.</p></article></div></div><aside class="surface accent-edge p-5 [--edge:var(--accent)] mt-6"><p class="text-xs text-accent">Fail closed</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">The Rust workspace links WDBX directly. Storage, authentication, and admission failures must be explicit; legacy disabled-feature flags are not the current runtime boundary.</p></aside><a class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-accent no-underline hover:underline" href="/research/wdbx-weighted-backtrace-memory-store">Read the paper: WDBX weighted-backtrace store<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" strok