itations, attachments and implementation limits.</p><h3 class="mt-5 font-medium text-fg">Before you start</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">A browser; no account or local setup required.</p><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border border-transparent font-medium whitespace-nowrap no-underline transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow,opacity,transform] duration-150 ease-out select-none focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:not-disabled:translate-y-px bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/80 h-11 rounded-md px-4 text-sm mt-6" href="/research">Browse research</a></div></article><article id="abbey" class="grid scroll-mt-32 gap-6 border-t border-border pt-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr]"><div><h2 class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight">Explore Abbey&#x27;s workspace</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-accent">Browser document preview</p></div><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-fg">Try the browser document loop. Model requests use a separate configured server path; documents are stored in this browser&#x27;s localStorage.</p><h3 class="mt-5 font-medium text-fg">Before you start</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">A browser. A configured server and model provider are required for model requests; the static preview cannot call a model.</p><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border border-transparent font-medium whitespace-nowrap no-underline transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow,opacity,transform] duration-150 ease-out select-none focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:not-disabled:translate-y-px bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/80 h-11 rounded-md px-4 text-sm mt-6" href="/workspace">Open browser workspace</a></div></article><article id="mobile" class="grid scroll-mt-32 gap-6 border-t border-border pt-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr]"><div><h2 class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight">Explore the mobile companion</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-accent">Browser vault preview; partial native shell source</p></div><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-fg">Try the browser vault preview. This page stores notes in localStorage. The separate Capacitor CloudKit plugin exposes availability and account-status checks; signed-device sync remains unverified.</p><h3 class="mt-5 font-medium text-fg">Before you start</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">A browser for the preview. Native shell work requires the separate native package and platform tooling; the copied native projects are not built or synced in the source receipt.</p><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border border-transparent font-medium whitespace-nowrap no-underline transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow,opacity,transform] duration-150 ease-out select-none focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:not-disabled:translate-y-px bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/80 h-11 rounded-md px-4 text-sm mt-6" href="/mobile">Open the web vault</a></div></article><article id="quasar" class="grid scroll-mt-32 gap-6 border-t border-border pt-8 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr]"><div><h2 class="font-display text-3xl tracking-tight">Build a site with Quasar</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-accent">Experimental local website builder with a browser client</p></div><div class="max-w-2xl"><p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-fg">Generate a Next.js website and preview it on your own machine. The service defaults to loopback and requires pairing for API operations. Generated project code runs as the operator. Live provider generation remains unverified; remote exposure requires operator-managed HTTPS and network opt-in.</p><h3 class="mt-5 font-medium text-fg">Before you start</h3><p class="mt-2 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Bun 1.4, this repository&#x27;s Quasar sidecar, service-side Anthropic credentials, and a browser paired to the separately running service.</p><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border border-transparent font-medium whitespace-nowrap no-underline transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow,opacity,transform] duration-150 ease-out select-none focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:not-disabled:translate-y-px bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/80 h-11 rounded-md px-4 text-sm mt-6" href="/quesar">Open Quasar studio</a></div></article></div><p class="mt-14 text-sm text-fg-muted">Looking for the whole product family?<!-- --> <a class="text-accent" href="/products">Compare products</a>.</p></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6"><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border border-transparent font-medium whitespace-nowrap no-underline transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow,opacity,transform] duration-150 ease-out select-none focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:not-disabled:translate-y-px bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/80 h-11 rounded-md px-4 text-sm" href="/docs/getting-started">Docs: getting started</a></div><div class="mt-10"><div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><a class="surface surface-hover p-5 no-underline" href="/architecture"><p class="text-xs text-accent">Next</p><h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-xl text-fg">Architecture</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Click a node for current versus not claimed.</p></a><a class="surface surface-hover p-5 no-underline" href="/apps"><p class="text-xs text-accent">Next</p><h