-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-menu size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16"></path><path d="M4 12h16"></path><path d="M4 19h16"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main id="main" tabindex="-1" class="flex-1"><!--$--><div class="border-b border-border"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pt-16 pb-14 sm:px-6 sm:pt-24 sm:pb-20"><p class="eyebrow">Local developer framework</p><h1 class="mt-5 max-w-4xl font-display text-4xl leading-[1.02] tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">ABI</h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-[62ch] text-lg leading-8 text-fg-muted">Explore deterministic persona routing, template completion, and source-defined tools.</p></div></div><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Availability</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">What you can use today</h2></header><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted sm:text-base">Local developer framework</p><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted sm:text-base">Local deterministic routing and template completion do not establish foundation-model quality. External providers need separate configuration.</p></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Setup</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">Prepare your environment</h2></header><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted sm:text-base">A source checkout, nightly Rust and the sibling workspaces required by the ABI README.</p></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Design context</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">Read the design alongside the evidence</h2></header><p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted sm:text-base">The following equations, persona descriptions and interactive demonstrations explain design intent. They do not establish trained-model quality, general safety, emotional understanding or implementation beyond the availability stated above. Follow the research links for source-backed status and limitations. The local Abbey document workspace and the ABI persona design are separate integration surfaces.</p></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Routing</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">The mathematics of orchestration</h2></header><div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2"><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 h-full text-fg"><div class="overflow-x-auto"><div tabindex="0" class="my-1 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg-subtle px-5 py-4 font-mono text-xs text-fg-subtle">P(p \mid I, C) = \mathrm{softmax}\big( f_\theta(I, C) \big)</div></div><p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Abi classifies intent and sentiment over input I and context C, scoring each persona.</p></article><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 h-full text-fg"><div class="overflow-x-auto"><div tabindex="0" class="my-1 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg-subtle px-5 py-4 font-mono text-xs text-fg-subtle">R_{\text{final}} = \alpha \cdot R_{\text{Abbey}} + (1 - \alpha) \cdot R_{\text{Aviva}}</div></div><p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Routing isn&#x27;t binary — Abi blends. High α leans empathetic and scaffolded; low α leans concise and unfiltered; in between, a factual core is wrapped in an empathetic voice.</p></article></div><div class="mt-6"><ul class="grid gap-3"><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-6"><p class="font-mono text-sm">α &gt; 0.8</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Pure Abbey — empathetic, scaffolded</p></article></li><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-6"><p class="font-mono text-sm">0.2 ≤ α ≤ 0.8</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Blend — Aviva&#x27;s facts, Abbey&#x27;s voice, mixed by Abi</p></article></li><li><article class="surface accent-edge p-6"><p class="font-mono text-sm">α &lt; 0.2</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Pure Aviva — concise, unfiltered</p></article></li></ul></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Try it</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">Watch Abi route in real time</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-fg-muted sm:text-lg">Type a message — an illustrative keyword-sentiment heuristic scores the blend coefficient α. The inspected local router uses deterministic rules; this demo is illustrative, not evidence of a learned classifier.</p></header><div class="mt-6"><div class="surface p-5 sm:p-6"><p class="text-xs text-accent">Persona router</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Illustrative keyword-sentiment heuristic. The inspected local router uses deterministic rules; this is not evidence of a learned classifier.</p><label class="mt-4 block"><span class="sr-only">Message</span><textarea rows="4" class="min-h-24 w-full rounded-md bg-bg px-3 py-3 text-sm text-fg shadow-border outline-none">I&#x27;m stuck on the deploy target and also need the exact schema.</textarea></label><dl class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3"><div><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Abbey α</p><div class="mt-2 h-1.5 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-bg-subtle"><div class="h-full rounded-full bg-persona-abbey" style="width:50%"></div></div><p class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs tabular text-fg">0.50</p></div><div><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Aviva 1−α</p><div class="mt-2 h-1.5 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-bg-subtle"><div class="h-full rounded-full bg-persona-aviva" style="width:50%"></div></div><p class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs tabular text-fg">0.50</p></div><div><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Abi blend</p><div class="mt-2 h-1.5 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-bg-subtle"><div class="h-full rounded-full bg-persona-abi" style="width:50%"></div></div><p class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs tabular text-fg">0.50</p></div></dl><p class="mt-4 text-xs text-fg-subtle">Blend — Aviva&#x27;s facts, Abbey&#x27;s voice, mixed by Abi</p><p class="mt-2 font-display text-xl">α = <!-- -->0.50</p></div></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Neural mechanism</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">Steering attention, not swapping weights</h2></header><div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2"><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 h-full text-fg"><div class="overflow-x-auto"><div tabindex="0" class="my-1 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg-subtle px-5 py-4 font-mono text-xs text-fg-subtle">\mathrm{Attention}(Q, K, V) = \mathrm{softmax}\!\left( \frac{QK^\top}{\sqrt{d_k}} \right) V</div></div><p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Standard multi-head attention — the shared engine.</p></article><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 h-full text-fg"><div class="overflow-x-auto"><div tabindex="0" class="my-1 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg-subtle px-5 py-4 font-mono text-xs text-fg-subtle">Q&#x27; = Q + z_{\text{persona}}</div></div><p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">A persona-embedding token shifts the query Q — rotating it toward empathetic keys (Abbey) or factual keys (Aviva). One model, many voices, no reload cost. This is the design mechanism; per-persona quality is evaluated, not assumed.</p></article></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">The trifecta</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">Three specialized minds</h2></header><div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3"><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 [--edge:var(--abbey)] flex h-full flex-col"><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Abbey — Empathic Polymath</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">High-EQ tutor and partner, tuned toward empathetic dialogue and scaffolded teaching.</p><div class="mt-auto overflow-x-auto pt-4 text-fg"><div tabindex="0" class="my-1 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg-subtle px-5 py-4 font-mono text-xs text-fg-subtle">L = L_{NLL} + \lambda \cdot L_{empathy} + L_{technical}</div></div></article><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 [--edge:var(--abi)] flex h-full flex-col"><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Aviva — Unfiltered Expert</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">High-IQ, low-latency by design. Strips hedges and preambles; generating fewer tokens is the efficiency lever.</p><div class="mt-auto overflow-x-auto pt-4 text-fg"><div tabindex="0" class="my-1 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg-subtle px-5 py-4 font-mono text-xs text-fg-subtle">L = L_{factual} + \gamma \cdot L_{directness}</div></div></article><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 [--edge:var(--abi)] flex h-full flex-col"><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Abi — Adaptive Moderator</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">The gateway: classifies intent, moderates content, routes and blends. The system&#x27;s regulatory firewall.</p><div class="mt-auto overflow-x-auto pt-4 text-fg"><div tabindex="0" class="my-1 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg-subtle px-5 py-4 font-mono text-xs text-fg-subtle">L = L_{moderation} + \delta \cdot L_{sentiment}</div></div></article></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Safety</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">Bias, quantified</h2></header><div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2"><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 h-full text-fg"><div class="overflow-x-auto"><div tabindex="0" class="my-1 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-border bg-bg-subtle px-5 py-4 font-mono text-xs text-fg-subtle">\mathrm{Score}_{bias} = \frac{1}{n} \sum_{i=1}^{n} |B_i|</div></div><p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Abi measures bias across n protected attributes. Exceed the threshold and the response is rejected, regenerated, or post-filtered — a gate in the response path, not an after-the-fact report.</p></article></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Acceleration</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">Hardware backends</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-fg-muted sm:text-lg">The inspected Rust implementation provides CPU vector operations and optional macOS Metal DOT dispatch. CUDA and Vulkan dispatch are not linked in this implementation; device acceleration needs separate validation.</p></header><div class="mt-4"><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="rounded-full bg-muted px-3 py-1 font-mono text-2xs text-muted-foreground">CPU vector operations</span><span class="rounded-full bg-muted px-3 py-1 font-mono text-2xs text-muted-foreground">Optional macOS Metal DOT</span></div></div></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Next</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">Keep going.</h2></header><div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><a class="surface surface-hover p-5 no-underline" href="/docs/getting-started"><p class="text-xs text-accent">Next</p><h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-xl text-fg">Setup documentation</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">A source checkout, nightly Rust and the sibling workspaces required by the ABI README.</p></a><a class="surface surface-hover p-5 no-underline" href="/research/ai-overview"><p class="text-xs text-accent">Next</p><h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-xl text-fg">AI &amp; agent behavior</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Read the supporting research and its limitations.</p></a><a class="surface surface-ho