ps://github.com/donaldfilimon/quesar.cloud/blob/f3ccc082f72ef868ca3c3a60f332f7efe9cfe492/src/lib/mlai/categories/product-journeys.ts" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="mt-4 inline-block text-sm text-accent underline underline-offset-4">Inspect the source behind this page</a></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2"><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 [--edge:var(--abi)] flex h-full flex-col"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Local developer framework</p><h2 class="mt-1 font-display text-3xl tracking-tight"><a class="text-fg no-underline hover:underline" href="/products/abi">ABI</a></h2><p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-fg">Explore deterministic persona routing, template completion, and source-defined tools.</p><p class="mt-4 text-sm text-accent">Local developer framework</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Local deterministic routing and template completion do not establish foundation-model quality. External providers need separate configuration.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-5 pt-6 text-sm"><a class="text-fg underline underline-offset-4" href="/products/abi">Explore <!-- -->ABI</a><a class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4" href="/docs/getting-started">Setup documentation</a></div></article><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 [--edge:var(--abbey)] flex h-full flex-col"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Browser document preview</p><h2 class="mt-1 font-display text-3xl tracking-tight"><a class="text-fg no-underline hover:underline" href="/products/abbey">Abbey</a></h2><p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-fg">Explore a browser document workspace and its optional configured server model-request path.</p><p class="mt-4 text-sm text-accent">Browser document preview</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Documents are stored in this browser&#x27;s localStorage. This preview does not establish setup or acceptance for a separate Abbey app.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-5 pt-6 text-sm"><a class="text-fg underline underline-offset-4" href="/products/abbey">Explore <!-- -->Abbey</a><a class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4" href="/workspace">Setup documentation</a></div></article><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 [--edge:var(--abi)] flex h-full flex-col"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Implemented Rust components for local integration</p><h2 class="mt-1 font-display text-3xl tracking-tight"><a class="text-fg no-underline hover:underline" href="/products/wdbx">WDBX</a></h2><p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-fg">Store durable records and retrieve vectors with inspectable provenance.</p><p class="mt-4 text-sm text-accent">Implemented Rust components for local integration</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Storage integrity does not prove the truth of stored statements. The reference cluster protocol does not establish production multi-host operation or sharding.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-5 pt-6 text-sm"><a class="text-fg underline underline-offset-4" href="/products/wdbx">Explore <!-- -->WDBX</a><a class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4" href="/wdbx">Setup documentation</a></div></article><article class="surface accent-edge p-6 [--edge:var(--abi)] flex h-full flex-col"><p class="text-xs text-fg-subtle">Experimental local website builder with a browser client</p><h2 class="mt-1 font-display text-3xl tracking-tight"><a class="text-fg no-underline hover:underline" href="/products/quasar">Quasar</a></h2><p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed text-fg">Generate a Next.js website and preview it on your own machine.</p><p class="mt-4 text-sm text-accent">Experimental local website builder with a browser client</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">The service defaults to loopback and requires pairing for API operations. Generated project code runs as the operator. Live provider generation remains unverified; remote exposure requires operator-managed HTTPS and network opt-in.</p><div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-5 pt-6 text-sm"><a class="text-fg underline underline-offset-4" href="/products/quasar">Explore <!-- -->Quasar</a><a class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4" href="/quesar">Setup documentation</a></div></article></div><p class="mt-10 text-sm text-fg-muted">Choose by what you want to do:<!-- --> <a class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4" href="/get-started">Get started</a>. Inspect the supporting<!-- --> <a class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4" href="/research">research collection</a>.</p></section><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6"><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border border-transparent font-medium whitespace-nowrap no-underline transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow,opacity,transform] duration-150 ease-out select-none focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:not-disabled:translate-y-px bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/80 h-11 rounded-md px-4 text-sm" href="/contact">Discuss your project</a><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border font-medium whitespace-nowrap no-underline transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow,opacity,transform] duration-150 ease-out select-none focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 active:not-disabled:translate-y-px border-border bg-card/80 text-foreground hover:bg-muted h-11 rounded-md px-4 text-sm" href="/architecture">Architecture</a><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 border font-medium whitespace-nowrap no-underline transition-[background-color,color,box-shadow,opacity,transform] duration-150 ease-out select-none focus-visible:outline-2 focus