verview">TUI &amp; operator tools</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/research/tui-implementation-guide">Using the local diagnostics dashboard and agent REPL</a></li></ul></div><div class="mt-6"><a class="text-xs text-fg-subtle no-underline hover:text-fg" href="/research/implementations">Implementations</a><ul class="mt-2 space-y-0.5"><li><a class="flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/research/implementations/six-layer-evidence-aware-platform">A six-layer architecture for evidence-aware AI systems</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/research/implementations/private-document-intelligence-pipeline">A private document pipeline with explicit fallback behavior</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/research/implementations/mobile-vault-cloudkit-local-fallback">Mobile Vault persistence across CloudKit and local fallback</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/research/implementations/quasar-bounded-repository-generation">Quasar as a bounded repository-generation loop</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/research/implementations/abbey-executable-capability-ledger">Abbey capability claims as an executable ledger</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/research/implementations/wdbx-specimen-architecture-and-conformance">WDBX Specimen separates architecture, runtime profiles, and proof</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/research/implementations/deterministic-research-provenance-exports">Deterministic research exports with citation gates</a></li></ul></div></nav><div><div class="mb-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2"><article class="surface accent-edge p-6"><p class="text-xs text-accent">Practical summary</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Evaluate assistant workflows with explicit behavior, provider and review boundaries.</p></article><article class="surface accent-edge p-6"><p class="text-xs text-accent">Status</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Implementation status applies to the bounded source capabilities described here, not to a hosted product or benchmark result.</p><p class="mt-2 font-mono text-2xs text-fg-subtle">Reviewed <!-- -->2026-09-30</p></article></div><nav aria-label="Related products" class="mb-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm"><a class="text-accent" href="/products/abi">Explore <!-- -->ABI</a><a class="text-accent" href="/products/abbey">Explore <!-- -->Abbey</a><a class="text-accent" href="/products">All products</a></nav><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-10"><article><h2 id="what-it-can-help-with" class="scroll-mt-24 font-display text-[1.65rem] leading-tight tracking-tight text-fg">What it can help with</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-8 text-fg">Evaluate assistant workflows with explicit behavior, provider and review boundaries.</p><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-8 text-fg">These are potential pilot applications, not claims of customer outcomes.</p></article><article><h2 id="what-the-source-implements" class="scroll-mt-24 font-display text-[1.65rem] leading-tight tracking-tight text-fg">What the source implements</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-8 text-fg">The local completion function selects a profile from keyword signals and renders an in-process persona template. The requested model identifier is metadata on this route, not proof that the named model ran. A hard constitutional veto substitutes a refusal in the returned local output.</p></article><article><h2 id="available-today" class="scroll-mt-24 font-display text-[1.65rem] leading-tight tracking-tight text-fg">Available today</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-8 text-fg">Local deterministic routing and completion are implemented; model quality requires separate evaluation.</p></article><article><h2 id="how-to-evaluate-it" class="scroll-mt-24 font-display text-[1.65rem] leading-tight tracking-tight text-fg">How to evaluate it</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-8 text-fg">For a customer pilot, choose a concrete task and identify whether it uses local templates or an explicitly configured provider. Evaluate task correctness, escalation and data handling with representative inputs before making quality claims.</p></article><article><h2 id="supporting-research-and-guides" class="scroll-mt-24 font-display text-[1.65rem] leading-tight tracking-tight text-fg">Supporting research and guides</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-8 text-fg">Read the accompanying archive entries: Policy-Locked Tool Use in Multi-Agent Systems; Human Approval Gates That Operators Actually Use; Offline-First AI Workflows for Sensitive Data; Prompt Injection Drills for Agentic Systems; Multi-Persona Routing Under Uncertainty: Policy Weights and Request Classification. Each distinguishes implemented behavior from proposed applications and includes pinned implementation evidence.</p></article></div><h3 class="mt-10 font-display text-xl">Limitations</h3><div class="mt-3"><ul class="grid gap-3 text-sm text-fg-muted sm:grid-cols-2"><li class="surface px-4 py-3">Local completion renders persona templates; it is not evidence of a trained foundation model.</li><li class="surface px-4 py-3">Keyword-based checks cannot establish general safety or emotional understanding.</li></ul></div><div class="mt-10 grid gap-8"><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Supporting sources</h3><ul class="mt-3 space-y-3"><li class="surface p-4"><a class="text-sm font-medium text-accent no-underline hover:underline" href="/abi">Local completion and adaptive routing</a><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-fg-muted">source<!-- --> · revision<!-- --> <code class="break-all font-mono">80dfe079ebe7413a6815c2d564be1f0aaa901267</code></p></li><li class="surface p-4"><a class="text-sm font-medium text-accent no-underline hover:underline" href="/abi">Deterministic persona router</a><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-fg-muted">source<!-- --> · revision<!-- --> <code class="break-all font-mono">80dfe079ebe7413a6815c2d564be1f0aaa901267</code></p></li><li class="surface p-4"><a class="text-sm font-medium text-accent no-underline hover:underline" href="/abi">Constitutional checks and veto rules</a><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-fg-muted">source<!-- --> · revision<!-- --> <code class="break-all font-mono">80dfe079ebe7413a6815c2d564be1f0aaa901267</code></p></li></ul></div></div><div class="mt-12 grid gap-8"><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">More on this track</h3><ul class="mt-3 grid gap-3"><li><a class="text-sm text-accent no-underline hover:underline" href="/research/policy-locked-tool-use-multi-agent">Policy-Locked Tool Use in Multi-Agent Systems</a></li><li><a class="text-sm text-accent no-underline hover:underline" href="/research/human-approval-gates-operators-use">Human Approval Gates That Operators Actually Use</a></li><li><a class="text-sm text-accent no-underline hover:underline" href="/research/offline-first-ai-sensitive-data">Offline-First AI Workflows for Sensitive Data</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Nested implementations</h3><ul class="mt-3 grid gap-3"><li><a class="text-sm text-accent no-underline hover:underline" href="/research/implementation