">Using the local diagnostics dashboard and agent REPL</a></li></ul></div><div class="mt-6"><a class="text-xs text-fg-subtle no-underline hover:text-fg" href="/research/implementations">Implementations</a><ul class="mt-2 space-y-0.5"><li><a class="flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/research/implementations/six-layer-evidence-aware-platform">A six-layer architecture for evidence-aware AI systems</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/research/implementations/private-document-intelligence-pipeline">A private document pipeline with explicit fallback behavior</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/research/implementations/mobile-vault-cloudkit-local-fallback">Mobile Vault persistence across CloudKit and local fallback</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/research/implementations/quasar-bounded-repository-generation">Quasar as a bounded repository-generation loop</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/research/implementations/abbey-executable-capability-ledger">Abbey capability claims as an executable ledger</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/research/implementations/wdbx-specimen-architecture-and-conformance">WDBX Specimen separates architecture, runtime profiles, and proof</a></li><li><a class="flex min-h-10 items-center rounded-md px-2 text-sm no-underline transition-colors text-fg-muted hover:bg-muted hover:text-fg" href="/research/implementations/deterministic-research-provenance-exports">Deterministic research exports with citation gates</a></li></ul></div></nav><div><div class="mb-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2"><article class="surface accent-edge p-6"><p class="text-xs text-accent">Practical summary</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Evaluate a local integration from an MCP client into the ABI tool catalog.</p></article><article class="surface accent-edge p-6"><p class="text-xs text-accent">Status</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-fg-muted">Implementation status applies to the bounded source capabilities described here, not to a hosted product or benchmark result.</p><p class="mt-2 font-mono text-2xs text-fg-subtle">Reviewed <!-- -->2026-09-30</p></article></div><nav aria-label="Related products" class="mb-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm"><a class="text-accent" href="/products/abi">Explore <!-- -->ABI</a><a class="text-accent" href="/products/quasar">Explore <!-- -->Quasar</a><a class="text-accent" href="/products">All products</a></nav><div class="max-w-3xl space-y-10"><article><h2 id="what-it-can-help-with" class="scroll-mt-24 font-display text-[1.65rem] leading-tight tracking-tight text-fg">What it can help with</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-8 text-fg">Evaluate a local integration from an MCP client into the ABI tool catalog.</p><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-8 text-fg">These are potential pilot applications, not claims of customer outcomes.</p></article><article><h2 id="what-the-source-implements" class="scroll-mt-24 font-display text-[1.65rem] leading-tight tracking-tight text-fg">What the source implements</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-8 text-fg">The handler catalog defines twelve tools spanning AI completion, learning and training, WDBX query and statistics, scheduler inspection, connectors, GPU status and plugins. Requests pass through explicit argument validation and dispatch.</p></article><article><h2 id="available-today" class="scroll-mt-24 font-display text-[1.65rem] leading-tight tracking-tight text-fg">Available today</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-8 text-fg">The twelve-tool stdio JSON-RPC contract is implemented.</p></article><article><h2 id="how-to-evaluate-it" class="scroll-mt-24 font-display text-[1.65rem] leading-tight tracking-tight text-fg">How to evaluate it</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-8 text-fg">Start with initialization and tool discovery, then a harmless read-only call. Validate the exact client transport and required arguments. Enable writes or provider calls only within the intended application permissions.</p></article><article><h2 id="supporting-research-and-guides" class="scroll-mt-24 font-display text-[1.65rem] leading-tight tracking-tight text-fg">Supporting research and guides</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-base leading-8 text-fg">Read the accompanying archive entries: Connecting an MCP client to ABI. Each distinguishes implemented behavior from proposed applications and includes pinned implementation evidence.</p></article></div><h3 class="mt-10 font-display text-xl">Limitations</h3><div class="mt-3"><ul class="grid gap-3 text-sm text-fg-muted sm:grid-cols-2"><li class="surface px-4 py-3">The best-effort loopback HTTP listener (127.0.0.1 only) serves MCP 2024-11-05 HTTP+SSE sessions; it is not a general web server and not Streamable HTTP (2025-03-26).</li><li class="surface px-4 py-3">A listed tool does not prove provider credentials, production access or remote deployment.</li></ul></div><div class="mt-10 grid gap-8"><div><h3 class="font-display text-xl">Supporting sources</h3><ul class="mt-3 space-y-3"><li class="surface p-4"><a class="text-sm font-medium text-accent no-underline hover:underline" href="/abi">Twelve-tool MCP contract</a><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-fg-muted">source<!-- --> · revision<!-- --> <code class="break-all font-mono">80dfe079ebe7413a6815c2d564be1f0aaa901267