-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-current" title="Present in public source and used as described."><span aria-hidden="true">●</span>Current</span><span class="text-sm text-fg-muted">Structural substrate is in source. Evidence-weighted retrieval is planned.</span></div></div></div><section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-28"><header class="mb-12 max-w-3xl"><p class="eyebrow">Capabilities</p><h2 class="section-title mt-4 text-fg">Implemented structure. Honest gaps.</h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-fg-muted sm:text-lg">Status is measured against the source, not against a product name. Storage integrity does not establish truth. The reference cluster protocol does not establish production sharding.</p></header><div tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Scrollable data table" class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl shadow-border focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-accent"><table class="w-full text-left text-sm" style="min-width:40rem"><thead class="bg-bg-elevated text-fg-muted"><tr><th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Concern</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">What exists</th><th class="px-4 py-3 font-medium">Status</th></tr></thead><tbody class="divide-y divide-border bg-bg"><tr><td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="font-medium">Blocks / segments</span></td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-fg-muted">On-disk segment format, CRC-framed WAL, checkpoint publication and salvage</td><td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-current" title="Present in public source and used as described."><span aria-hidden="true">●</span>Current</span></td></tr><tr><td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="font-medium">Embeddings / search</span></td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-fg-muted">Exact and layered HNSW, ordered vector search, 3-D spatial index</td><td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-current" title="Present in public source and used as described."><span aria-hidden="true">●</span>Current</span></td></tr><tr><td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="font-medium">Metadata</span></td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-fg-muted">Block metadata round-tripping, versioning, access and execution state in records</td><td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-current" title="Present in public source and used as described."><span aria-hidden="true">●</span>Current</span></td></tr><tr><td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="font-medium">Relationships</span></td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-fg-muted">Multi-parent causal audit DAG</td><td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-current" title="Present in public source and used as described."><span aria-hidden="true">●</span>Current</span></td></tr><tr><td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="font-medium">Provenance</span></td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-fg-muted">SHA-256 content addressing, Ed25519 signing, deterministic CBOR envelopes</td><td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-current" title="Present in public source and used as described."><span aria-hidden="true">●</span>Current</span></td></tr><tr><td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="font-medium">Retrieval</span></td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-fg-muted">Hybrid ranking contracts; score currently collapses several axes</td><td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-partial" title="Implemented in part. Scope is named on the page."><span aria-hidden="true">◐</span>Partial</span></td></tr><tr><td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="font-medium">Evidence-weighted rank</span></td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-fg-muted">Separate semantic, temporal, causal, and persona signals</td><td class="px-4 py-3"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-status-planned" title="Inte